'''Keiji Claus''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] introduced in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals Gacha Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]] gains [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] Target and activates his [[Strengthen]] sooner. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

